fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gstvp8parser.html#GstVp8MvProbs","fragment":"\n\tGstVp8MvProbs\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.Vp8MvProbs\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.Vp8MvProbs\n\nMembers\nProbabilities used for motion vector decoding, with cumulative\nupdates applied.\nEach probability value in this matrix is live across frames, until\nthey are reset to their default values on key frame.\nMV probability\nProbabilities used for motion vector decoding, with cumulative\nupdates applied.\nEach probability value in this matrix is live across frames, until\nthey are reset to their default values on key frame.\nMV probability\nProbabilities used for motion vector decoding, with cumulative\nupdates applied.\nEach probability value in this matrix is live across frames, until\nthey are reset to their default values on key frame.\nMV probability\n"});